# Used instead of the context-root .dockerignore when building BcsCrystalReports/Dockerfile (Docker/BuildKit and
# podman/buildah pick "<Dockerfile>.dockerignore" first). The context is the parent directory
# (modernized/otr-sva-optimus-corredores, or modernized/ via ./otr-sva-optimus-corredores in the root compose):
# the Dockerfile only COPYs BcsCrystalReports/libs, pom.xml and src, so everything else (the other modules, their
# target/ directories, .git, .env files with secrets, test goldens, local tmp/) stays out of the build context.
*
!BcsCrystalReports/libs
!BcsCrystalReports/pom.xml
!BcsCrystalReports/src
BcsCrystalReports/src/test/resources
BcsCrystalReports/src/test/legacy-recorder
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/target
**/tmp
**/.git
**/__pycache__
